1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,170
Bepul yetkazish bepul emas.

2
00:00:03,170 --> 00:00:06,850
Uning pulini baribir to'laysan.

3
00:00:07,350 --> 00:00:09,890
Usta, shampun oldim, yetkazish yigirma ming ekan.

4
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:12,250
Yana qirq minglik narsa qo'shsam, bepul bo'larkan!

5
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:15,550
O'sha qirq minglik narsa senga kerakmi?

6
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:17,220
Unchalik emas...

7
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:18,590
lekin bepul-ku!

8
00:00:19,090 --> 00:00:20,800
Jim, Diyor.

9
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:21,940
Qara.

10
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:24,790
2002-yil, Amerika.

11
00:00:25,290 --> 00:00:38,830
Dunyodagi eng katta onlayn do'kon bepul yetkazishni 99 dollardan 49 dollarga, ikki oydan keyin 25 dollarga tushirdi.

12
00:00:39,330 --> 00:00:43,550
Odamlar chegaraga yetish uchun savatga yana narsa qo'shdi.

13
00:00:43,550 --> 00:00:46,720
Do'kon buni «ijobiy natija» deb e'lon qildi.

14
00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:49,300
Bizni sanashgan ekan-da?!

15
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:56,190
Faqat Fransiyada yetkazish uchun bir frank, ya'ni yigirma sent olishgan.

16
00:00:56,190 --> 00:00:59,380
U yerda sotuv deyarli o'smagan.

17
00:00:59,880 --> 00:01:04,340
Narxni nolga tushirishgan zahoti, u yerda ham sotuv o'sib ketdi.

18
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:06,340
Olimlar sinab ko'rgan:

19
00:01:06,340 --> 00:01:08,900
qimmat shokoladni ko'pchilik tanlagan.

20
00:01:08,900 --> 00:01:13,170
Arzonini «bepul» qilishgan zahoti, hamma bepuliga o'tgan.

21
00:01:13,670 --> 00:01:18,040
Demak, «bepul» so'zi miyani aldaydi?

22
00:01:18,340 --> 00:01:19,400
Aldamaydi.

23
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:20,710
Shoshiltiradi.

24
00:01:21,210 --> 00:01:22,210
Hisobla:

25
00:01:22,210 --> 00:01:26,210
yigirma ming tejading, qirq ming sarflading.

26
00:01:26,710 --> 00:01:27,730
Uchta qoida.

27
00:01:27,730 --> 00:01:29,550
Faqat kerakli narsani ol.

28
00:01:29,550 --> 00:01:34,020
Yaqinda baribir oladigan narsalarni bitta buyurtmaga yig'.

29
00:01:34,020 --> 00:01:34,630
Va so'ra:

30
00:01:34,630 --> 00:01:38,080
yetkazish pullik bo'lmaganida ham shuni olarmidim?

31
00:01:38,580 --> 00:01:45,220
Ular senga yetkazishni emas, «tekin» degan tuyg'uni sotadi.

32
00:01:45,220 --> 00:01:46,480
Har gal so'ra:

33
00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:49,010
bundan kim foyda ko'radi?

34
00:01:49,510 --> 00:01:53,560
Savatingizdagi narsalarni va yetkazish shartini botimizga yozing:

35
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:54,450
@sahiychishopbot.

36
00:01:54,450 --> 00:02:00,970
Bepul yetkazish uchun ortiqcha qancha to'layotganingizni hisoblab, nimani olib tashlash mumkinligini aytadi.

